Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:11.49,DCMain,CONAN,0,0,0,,Happy New Year, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:16.43,DCMain,CONAN,0,0,0,,As of today, {\i1}Detective Conan{\i0} is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:22.00,sign_1187_30th_anniversary,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs30\pos(209,167)\fad(200,1)\c&H0D1BBA&}Congrats!\N{\c&H2191F5&}30th {\c&HD44C1B&}Anniversary{\c&HAE11DB&}!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:20.87,DCMain,CONAN,0,0,0,,celebrating its 30th anniversary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.01,DCMain,CONAN,0,0,0,,This series has continued for this long\Nthanks to the support
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:32.78,DCMain,CONAN,0,0,0,,of viewers of the TV series and movies, and {\i1}Shonen Sunday{\i0} readers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:36.77,DCMain,CONAN,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:42.77,DCMain,CONAN,0,0,0,,We'll keep striving to pay back\Nyour unwavering belief in us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.57,0:00:47.28,DCMain,CONAN,0,0,0,,so we appreciate your continued support.
