Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:57.46,DCItalicTop,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,My name is Kudo Shinichi.\NI'm a high school detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:01:00.00,DCItalic,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,This story is from before\NI was given a mysterious drug...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.02,DCItalic,CONAN,0,0,0,,...and became Conan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:03.95,DCItalic,CONAN,0,0,0,,We've finally reached\Nour 30th anniversary!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.95,0:01:05.83,DCItalic,CONAN,0,0,0,,We'll keep on solving cases together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.83,0:01:08.88,DCItalic,SHINICHI & CONAN,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,800)}There is always only one truth!
