Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:34.21,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Shinichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:42.30,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:44.60,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You can't be late when {\i1}you{\i0} invited {\i1}me{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:47.61,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Sorry. Something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.61,0:03:51.24,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Why didn't you wait at the entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.24,0:03:52.97,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I had to look for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.97,0:03:56.76,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I felt an irresistible urge\Nto see the sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:03.39,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,It's a message from Sonoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:08.31,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Her cold's a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:10.70,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.15,0:04:25.34,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and check the\Nplace out for your whatever plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.34,0:04:27.66,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,It's not the "whatever plan."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:33.00,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,It's the Super Aquarium\NRomantic Reunion Plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:29.95,sign_1187_romantic_plan,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fad(500,1)\an2\frz12\t(100,233,\frz12,\frz0)\move(126,80,320,51,108,275)}Super Aquarium
