Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:39.15,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,First, I'll invite my dad to this aquarium\Nwhere he'll meet my mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:44.56,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,in this magical place surrounded by fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:48.66,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,They'll remember how they felt\Nwhen they loved each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:50.39,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,and start living together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:54.04,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Wasn't it {\i1}you{\i0} who came up\Nwith this plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:58.46,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Sonoko's the one who named it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.10,0:05:03.81,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But couldn't you have\Ncome to check it out yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.81,0:05:07.62,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,But I haven't been to the aquarium before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:09.78,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I felt anxious about coming alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:19.09,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I know you didn't want to come to\Nthis romantic date spot with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:23.44,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,But Sonoko caught a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:24.97,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,You were my only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:28.41,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I-It's not that I didn't want to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:30.68,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Then let's go to the aquarium café, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:31.84,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:34.86,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,They have lots of cute items on their menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:41.02,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Let me know what you think\Nso I can help my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:43.45,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:46.57,DCItalic,RAN/ID,0,0,0,,That's just an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.27,0:05:52.92,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Maybe they shouldn't meet\Nin front of the sharks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:54.92,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They have a bad reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:59.45,DCItalic,RAN/ID,0,0,0,,I actually wanted to come with Shinichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:02.17,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Hey, Shinichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:03.16,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:07.05,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Tada! What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:09.06,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:10.90,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,My clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.89,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I like this dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:16.52,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.84,0:06:20.07,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:25.32,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,If you need an opinion on\Nyour clothes so badly, ask your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:27.57,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Aren't you having dinner with her tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:28.72,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:31.25,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,H-How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.78,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.71,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It's a spotted eagle ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:37.96,DCItalic,RAN/ID,0,0,0,,I hate when he acts like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.74,0:06:42.46,DCItalic,RAN/ID,0,0,0,,He'll suddenly act like he read your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:46.63,DCItalic,RAN/ID,0,0,0,,but he won't explain how he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:49.27,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:51.76,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I haven't told my dad or Sonoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:53.60,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,How'd you know I'm meeting my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.55,0:06:57.10,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,You didn't look through my phone, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:07:03.44,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,After you checked Sonoko's email,\Nyou checked a previous message.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:10.71,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I naturally assumed you had plans after this\Nand were confirming the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.71,0:07:15.01,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,B-But you didn't see the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:17.90,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I could tell from your finger's movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:21.34,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,And that you're seeing your mom, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:25.34,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,What? That doesn't answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:30.75,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You've got fashion magazines\Nyou don't usually buy in your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:31.75,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:35.02,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,There's a business card\Nstuck between the pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:39.21,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Considering your confidence\Nin your outfit today,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:44.95,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,it's clear you were asked to be a\Nreader model, had some shots taken,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.95,0:07:48.70,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,and bought a magazine because\Nyou were in a good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:53.79,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You can brag that you \Nmight be in the next issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.54,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You should be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:59.25,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They don't give business cards\Nto just anyone they photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:01.23,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You'll probably be in the magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:07.82,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But in this area, model scouts only hang out\Naround the main street on Third.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:11.30,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,That's a little out of the way if\Nyou're coming to this aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:15.05,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Why did you take that path?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.65,0:08:19.64,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,There was somewhere you wanted\Nto go before coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:23.72,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I knew the answer when I saw your lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:24.90,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,My lips?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:25.82,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:27.68,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They're shining a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:33.70,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You don't wear lip balm, so you\Nprobably ate something oily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:36.94,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,There are fast food restaurants\Non that street,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:43.99,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,so it's possible you missed breakfast\Nand grabbed a burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:47.67,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But since you want to eat at\Nthe café here, that's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.41,0:08:53.44,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Which means you had a light snack...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:55.18,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,of supermarket samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:59.28,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The supermarket on that street\Nhas great pre-made dishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.94,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,and they have a sale today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:07.99,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,That means you're feeding your dad\Npre-made dishes for dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:12.34,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Why would you do that when\Nyou're frugal and a good cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:15.00,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Because you don't have time to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:19.09,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You're having dinner with someone tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:25.00,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Naturally, you'll proudly wear the outfit\Nthat caught the scout's eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:30.21,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You're not having dinner\Nwith Sonoko, who's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:38.52,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It was obvious enough from your expression,\Nbut that only leaves your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:44.77,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But it looks like you have\Nanother reason you can't cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:51.51,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Shinichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:55.24,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Ran, go back to the entrance\Nand call an employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:55.99,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:57.17,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:09:59.24,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Shinichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:01.89,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.89,0:10:03.25,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Let me through, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:05.16,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.63,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I said, let me—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:14.39,DCMain,MAN A,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.39,0:10:15.72,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:18.76,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Move away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:23.24,DCMain,MAN A,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:27.69,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,This isn't good.\NHe's not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.45,0:10:33.24,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,One stab through the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.85,0:10:37.95,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,The weapon is that knife\Nsticking through a plastic bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:40.80,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Shinichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:42.75,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I brought an employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:47.82,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Seal the aquarium's exits,\Nand call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:49.42,DCMain,EMPLOYEE,0,0,0,,What? Th-The police?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:50.30,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:52.32,DCMain,EMPLOYEE,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:57.05,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Don't let the other guests approach the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:00.55,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Th-The body?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:02.43,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:06.28,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yeah. Someone inside\Nthe aquarium stabbed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:10.55,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,But how? I didn't hear a scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.55,0:11:11.94,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:13.94,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:15.82,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,The smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:23.16,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Red blood cells contain a protein that\Ncarries oxygen called hemoglobin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.75,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It's mostly made of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:30.46,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,When you lick a cut,\Ndoesn't it taste like rusted iron?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:33.00,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Naturally, it smells like iron, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.37,0:11:35.67,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I didn't smell anything like that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:38.43,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They're like sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:39.18,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Sharks?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.23,0:11:46.91,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Sharks can smell one drop of blood\Ndiluted to one part per million.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:49.56,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Their ears are even sharper,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:54.74,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,allowing them to hear frequencies as low\Nas 40 hertz from two kilometers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.43,0:11:57.76,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They approach using their sense of smell,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:12:02.99,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,determine their prey's exact location\Nby their electric fields, and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.63,0:12:06.58,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They head to the crime scene\Nwhen they smell blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:10.75,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They use all their senses\Nto find the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:16.76,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They tear into their prey with the sharp\Nteeth of evidence until they admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:20.90,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,That's what a detective does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.61,0:12:40.74,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\move(,363,190,363,-48)\fscx90\fad(200,1)\fs16\xshad-1\yshad1\an8\frz-21\fax0.5}BEIKA AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:40.74,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:44.70,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN LEFT,0,0,0,,{\fs24\xshad-1\yshad1\an2\frz-9\fax0.2\t(\fs24,\fs26)\c&H8B523C&\move(191,61,182,42)}ENTRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:44.70,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN RIGHT,0,0,0,,{\fs23\xshad-1\yshad1\an2\frz-9\fax0.2\t(\fs23,\fs25)\c&H8B523C&\move(504,103,521,88)}EXIT
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:44.70,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,So the self-important young man\Ncommanding the crime scene
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:48.21,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,is you, Kudo-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:51.96,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Ran and I happened to be at the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:58.33,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I asked if anyone saw the culprit,\Nbut no one did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:13:00.86,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Is that right? So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:01.34,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.22,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Are you two on a date\Nat the aquarium?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.97,0:13:06.34,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Is that how it looks?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.34,0:13:08.57,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I-It's not like that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:09.95,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I'm joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:13.29,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,If you get flustered,\Nhe'll think it really {\i1}is{\i0} a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:17.56,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you can joke\Nwhen someone's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:24.01,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,It seems the weapon is\Nthis knife next to the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:30.78,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,The victim was stabbed\Nthrough this plastic bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:36.75,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The culprit did it to prevent the victim's\Nblood from getting on themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:43.26,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They turned the blade sideways so it would\Nslip between his ribs and hit his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:50.02,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They carefully withdrew the blade from under\Nhis jacket so blood wouldn't spill everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:53.84,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Then they hid the wound\Nwith his jacket, and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.84,0:13:58.15,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Surely the victim screamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:00.26,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,There must be witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:04.03,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,No. Look at the back of his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:07.73,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Someone pressed a stun gun into his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:12.74,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,If he was knocked unconscious before he\Nwas stabbed, he {\i1}couldn't{\i0} have screamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:13.92,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:18.93,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The blood was still flowing when I arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.93,0:14:21.81,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,so he was probably stabbed\Na few minutes earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.81,0:14:26.01,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Also, the stun gun is\Ninside his breast pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:30.80,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,This must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:36.47,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The culprit probably drew the victim's\Nattention to the bottom of the tank
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.47,0:14:38.86,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,by saying there was an unusual fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:47.91,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They hit him with the stun gun while he was\Nleaning against the tank, which knocked him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:53.00,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Instead of falling dramatically, the victim\Ninconspicuously slumped to the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:58.61,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,so they could take their time\Nstabbing him to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.51,0:15:04.51,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Then the culprit could be an\Nacquaintance of the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:10.14,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,But there are no cards, licenses,\Nor even a business card in his wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:13.29,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,We'll have to identify the victim first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:14.89,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Oh, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:19.40,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The victim is Shumoto Kunihiro-san, \N26 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:22.65,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,He works at a gas station in Haido City.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.65,0:15:27.02,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Today, he canceled his shift\Nbecause he had something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:32.94,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Maybe the victim brought his girlfriend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:38.04,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,A woman who is around 160 centimeters tall,\Nwearing a miniskirt, and likes dolphins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:40.61,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,H-How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.61,0:15:43.98,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The victim's phone was in his pocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.98,0:15:48.01,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,so I called a random number\Nin his contacts and called it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:53.68,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,"I found this phone.\NDo you know who it belongs to?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:56.77,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They told me his name,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:16:01.56,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,so I asked, "I'd like to return it.\NDo you know where he is now?"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:05.39,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They told me where he works, so\NI called the gas station, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.39,0:16:09.07,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I told him not to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:13.34,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It's fine. I told them the next time\Nthey get a call like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:17.57,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,they should tell the caller\Nto take the phone to a police box.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.57,0:16:18.95,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,You're unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:22.34,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Did his employer tell you\Nabout his lady friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:27.34,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,No. I looked at the receipt\Ninside the victim's wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:28.83,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,The receipt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:32.51,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yes. It's from the aquarium café.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:36.39,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It was issued about 15 minutes\Nbefore the body was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:43.40,sign_1187_receipt,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\move(345,231,280,-63)\frz7\fs24}BEIKA AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:43.40,sign_1187_receipt,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an6\frz7\fs18\b0\move(254,270,189,-24)}AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:43.40,sign_1187_receipt,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\frz7\fs18\b0\move(443,246,378,-48)}CAFÉ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:43.40,sign_1187_receipt,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\frz7\fs20\b1\move(410,283,345,-11)}RECEIPT
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:43.40,sign_1187_receipt,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\frz7\fs18\b1\move(246,366,181,72)}COFFEE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:43.40,sign_1187_receipt,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\frz7\fs18\b1\move(251,416,186,122)}TEA
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:43.40,sign_1187_receipt,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\frz7\fs18\b1\move(260,464,195,170)}DOLPHIN KEY CHAIN
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:43.40,sign_1187_receipt,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\frz7\fs18\b1\move(270,537,205,243)}TOTAL
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:43.40,sign_1187_receipt,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\frz7\fs18\b1\move(275,584,210,290)}TENDERED
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:43.40,sign_1187_receipt,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\frz7\fs18\b1\move(285,632,220,338)}CHANGE
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.72,0:16:41.35,DCMainTop,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The receipt lists one coffee as well as one tea,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.35,0:16:43.83,DCMainTop,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,so he must have been with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:46.77,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The timestamp is five minutes\Nbefore the dolphin show,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:50.91,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,so they probably waited at\Nthe café for it to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:56.98,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The receipt also lists a dolphin\Nkey chain sold by the café,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.98,0:16:59.53,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,but the victim doesn't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.53,0:17:02.82,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I can only imagine he gave it\Nto his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.82,0:17:07.03,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,What about the 160 centimeters\Nand the miniskirt, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.03,0:17:10.28,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You're still too innocent to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:12.43,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,What does that mean? Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:15.30,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean, Kudo-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:16.76,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It's the smell of perfume.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:18.03,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Perfume?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:27.15,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You can smell women's perfume on the\Nvictim's shoulder, elbow, and thigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:30.53,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Women apply perfume to various places.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:36.47,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,If the smell got on the victim\Nwhile she was holding his arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:41.66,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,the smell on his shoulder must come from\Nthe perfume on her earlobes or hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:45.76,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The victim is about 180 centimeters tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:50.67,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,so based on the location of the perfume,\Nthe woman is about 165 centimeters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.41,0:17:56.69,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Since she likely wore high heels to her date,\Nsubtract five to eight centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:59.93,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,That would make her\Naround 160 centimeters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:03.68,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The smell on his elbow is from\Nthe perfume on her wrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:08.19,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The smell on his thigh is from\Nthe perfume on her skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:13.70,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Based on the locations and her height,\Nshe's probably wearing a miniskirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.34,0:18:20.11,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Normally, you only\Napply perfume to one location.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.11,0:18:23.70,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Does that mean\Nshe doesn't often wear perfume?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:26.58,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You can't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.17,0:18:31.83,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,If you wear the same perfume all the\Ntime, you get used to the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.83,0:18:36.06,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Sometimes, you'll apply extra\Nthinking no one can smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:37.60,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,That's what my mom told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.91,0:18:41.86,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,But why won't\Nthat woman come forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:44.18,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Her boyfriend is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:45.40,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:50.11,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Maybe they haven't been dating long,\Nand she doesn't want to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:54.49,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Maybe {\i1}she's{\i0} the one who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.90,0:19:04.15,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,In any case, you should collect all the phones,\Ncameras, and video cameras from the guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:12.38,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Someone may have caught the\Nculprit stabbing the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:14.88,sign_note,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(1,1)\p1\bord1\c&HE1E2DF&\3c&HC0C0C0&\4c&HE1E2DF&\pos(-6,-5)\fscx103\fscy106}m 285 15 l 15 15 15 105 285 105
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:14.88,sign_note,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(1,1)\p1\bord1\c&HE1E2DF&\3c&HC0C0C0&\4c&HE1E2DF&\fscx101\fscy100\pos(-3,-1)}m 285 15 l 15 15 15 105 285 105
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.38,0:19:14.88,sign_1187_staff_only,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(150,60)\c&H514B43&}DO NOT ENTER\NWITHOUT AUTHORIZATION\N\NSTAFF ONLY
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.01,0:19:14.88,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Come on, Kudo-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:17.61,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,There are over a hundred of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:21.89,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,You want us to check all of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:28.44,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,And most of the images are of fish...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.89,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I'm sure they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:31.82,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:34.57,sign_1187_incoming_text,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(310,161)\an2\fs9\frz-15\fax-0.4}NEW MESSAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:34.57,sign_1187_incoming_text,SIGN LEFT,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs9\pos(286,189)\frz-15\fax-0.4}DISMISS
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:34.57,sign_1187_incoming_text,SIGN RIGHT,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs9\pos(291,191)\frz-15\fax-0.4}VIEW
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:35.95,sign_1187_incoming_text,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an6\fs9\bord0\frz10\fax0.3\pos(346,119)}NEW MESSAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:35.95,sign_1187_incoming_text,SIGN LEFT,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs9\pos(335,164)\frz10\fax0.3}DISMISS
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:35.95,sign_1187_incoming_text,SIGN RIGHT,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs9\frz10\fax0.3\pos(355,160)}VIEW
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.32,sign_1187_incoming_text,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord0\an6\fs11\pos(353,121)}NEW MESSAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.32,sign_1187_incoming_text,SIGN LEFT,0,0,0,,{\pos(294,168)\an8\fs11}DISMISS
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.32,sign_1187_incoming_text,SIGN RIGHT,0,0,0,,{\pos(349,168)\an8\fs11}VIEW
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:40.14,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,The phones keep going off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:48.86,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I just messaged the victim's contacts\Nthat didn't respond before you arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:55.59,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,People will turn on their phones\Nfor a police inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.59,0:19:59.59,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Let's call in those three and ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:04.10,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Why did they ignore the\Nvictim's calls and messages?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:15.36,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs22\fad(300,1)\an8\frz12\fax-0.3\move(500,236,340,236)}BEIKA AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:15.86,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I got scared, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:19.88,DCMainTop,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I met him when he hit on me last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:20.37,sign_suspect,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\3c&HA64C46&\pos(372,254)}Nakagiri Kanoko (27)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:20.37,sign_suspect,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs14\pos(370,271)\3c&HA64C46&}Aquarium Guest
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:23.24,DCMainTop,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,And something seemed a little sketchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.15,0:20:27.21,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I had a feeling I shouldn't get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:29.77,DCItalic,RAN/ID,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.77,0:20:34.70,DCItalic,RAN/ID,0,0,0,,She's wearing a miniskirt, reeks of perfume,\Nand is about 160 centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.18,0:20:36.67,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:39.03,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.03,0:20:41.25,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,See? Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:46.91,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,So you're the one who came to\Nthe aquarium with the victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.91,0:20:47.73,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:52.92,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I said I liked dolphins, so he\Ninvited me to the aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:56.23,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,So you saw the dolphin show?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.23,0:20:58.72,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Yeah, with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.13,0:21:03.49,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,But he went to the bathroom during\Nthe show and never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:05.58,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,He missed the whole dolphin show.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.85,0:21:12.13,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I went looking for him to give him\Nan earful, but that was a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:16.13,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,He was dead and bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:19.54,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I had an even bigger shock later...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:22.26,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,when I got a call from his phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:29.77,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Everyone around me said he'd\Nbeen stabbed, so I ignored it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.31,0:21:36.71,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I thought whoever stabbed him\Nmight be coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:39.15,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Why did you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:44.06,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,He was having a sketchy\Nconversation on his phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.06,0:21:47.71,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Something about,\N"I'll definitely get the money."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.09,0:21:53.17,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute! Do you think {\i1}I{\i0} did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:22:00.25,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Y-You can't be serious! I didn't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:02.56,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I have the video to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.56,0:22:04.05,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Video proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:09.01,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I filmed the dolphin show so\NI could show him when he got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.01,0:22:10.06,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:12.06,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,See? This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.21,0:22:16.06,DCItalic,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,The front row is soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.06,0:22:17.45,DCItalic,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.96,0:22:21.60,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,You found his body before noon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.60,0:22:22.67,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.67,0:22:25.95,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,The dolphin show\Nended at exactly 12 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.38,0:22:28.73,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I filmed the whole dolphin show.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.73,0:22:30.83,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,My voice is on the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:33.71,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Isn't this an alibi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.73,0:22:36.21,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,I-I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:40.46,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs32\an8\frz19\fax-0.4\move(245,372,245,320)}BEIKA {\fax-0.3}AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.55,0:22:42.40,DCMainTop,OJIRO,0,0,0,,What? Shumoto-kun was the victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:45.47,sign_suspect,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(200,254)}Ojiro Naho (26)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:45.47,sign_suspect,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs14\pos(200,271)}Aquarium Guest
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.37,0:22:48.47,DCMainTop,OJIRO,0,0,0,,I heard a man had been stabbed,\Nbut I never thought it'd be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:52.23,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,What was your relationship with the victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:54.36,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,He was my ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.87,0:22:57.69,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,It's been over a year since we broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.69,0:23:01.48,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Why did you ignore his call?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.57,0:23:06.45,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,He kept trying to get back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:10.75,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,And I was on a date today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.26,0:23:14.53,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,So I turned off my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.53,0:23:17.63,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Were you with your boyfriend\Nthe whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.63,0:23:18.74,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.36,0:23:24.31,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,This is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:25.26,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\bord2\an8\frz-7\fax-0.2\3c&HEDF2F1&\move(264,33,264,137)}BEIKA AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.99,0:23:28.39,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,You can ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.39,0:23:31.10,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,But a lover's testimony is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:36.85,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\NI was filming when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.85,0:23:38.77,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.77,0:23:46.15,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,It's been ten minutes,\Nbut nothing's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:47.42,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:51.05,DCItalicTop,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Ran, go back to the entrance\Nand call an employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.32,0:23:49.66,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,We're in the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:51.67,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.05,0:23:52.11,DCItalicTop,RAN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.11,0:23:53.19,DCItalicTop,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.19,0:23:54.60,DCItalicTop,RAN,0,0,0,,Shinichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.19,0:23:54.60,DCItalic,JINBE,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:56.70,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,That's my boyfriend's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.59,0:23:58.88,DCItalicTop,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Something seems to have happened.\NShould we check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.55,DCItalicTop,JINBE,0,0,0,,No—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:03.81,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,You certainly seem to have taken this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.95,0:24:08.56,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Why was Shumoto-kun here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.39,0:24:12.51,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,He was on a date with his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.51,0:24:19.27,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,I see. Then maybe he just called\Nto introduce her to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.27,0:24:23.52,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs26\an8\frz-3.5\fax0.0\blur0.3\yshad2\xshad-1\4c&H452419&\c&H97704D&\move(415,187,274,187)}BEIKA {\fax0.1}AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.86,0:24:22.83,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.83,0:24:26.24,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Are you dating Ojiro Naho-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:29.99,DCMainTop,JINBE,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.49,0:24:29.99,sign_suspect,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)\pos(320,255)}Jinbe Kodai (28)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.49,0:24:29.99,sign_suspect,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)\fs14\pos(320,272)}Aquarium Guest
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.43,0:24:33.16,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,She just told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.16,0:24:38.16,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,And that the man killed here\Ntoday was her ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.16,0:24:39.30,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.30,0:24:41.47,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,Someone killed Naho's ex-boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.47,0:24:42.50,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.50,0:24:43.50,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.50,0:24:45.00,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Jinbe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.29,0:24:49.26,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You knew her ex, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.26,0:24:50.80,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,O-Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.80,0:24:52.30,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,It's news to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:56.56,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But your contact information\Nwas on his phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.90,0:24:59.67,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You also ignored the message I sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.67,0:25:04.32,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,What? Oh, you mean the one that\Nsaid, "Contact me immediately"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.77,0:25:09.80,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,I've received prank messages from that\Naddress before, so I deleted it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.80,0:25:11.93,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,I've gotten them a lot lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.93,0:25:15.17,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,"Click to see my secret."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.17,0:25:16.83,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,Shady ones like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.19,0:25:21.13,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,You're saying they came from\NNaho's ex-boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.13,0:25:23.33,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Yes, it seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.77,0:25:30.47,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,By the way, like Ojiro-san, you seem to have\Nbeen filming when the crime took place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.47,0:25:34.45,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,Oh, right. You mean this video?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.69,0:25:41.08,DCItalic,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Ran, go back to the entrance\Nand call an employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:41.99,DCItalic,RAN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.99,0:25:43.03,DCItalic,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.03,0:25:44.48,DCItalic,RAN,0,0,0,,Shinichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.03,0:25:44.48,DCItalicTop,JINBE,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.29,0:25:48.57,DCItalic,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Something seems to have happened.\NShould we check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.57,0:25:51.08,DCItalic,JINBE,0,0,0,,No, let's not get involved—
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.42,0:25:55.49,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,There are ten minutes\Nof video preceding this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.11,0:25:59.96,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,We were going to upload\Nour videos to our blogs later.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.88,0:26:03.36,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,You're welcome to watch\Nthe whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.36,0:26:06.27,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,In that case, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.65,0:26:28.40,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fad(300,1)\an8\frx5\xshad0\yshad2\c&H87663F&\4c&H3A2522&\move(317,390,317,257)}BEIKA AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.39,0:26:28.40,DCMainTop,POLICE A,0,0,0,,Inspector Megure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:33.90,DCMain,POLICE A,0,0,0,,We compared Nakagiri-san's dolphin\Nshow video to those of other guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.30,0:26:39.15,DCMain,POLICE A,0,0,0,,It was definitely taken\Nwhen the murder occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.15,0:26:40.64,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.64,0:26:44.04,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,The other suspects' videos weren't\Nfilmed by fixed cameras either.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.04,0:26:46.50,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,They were filmed by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.77,0:26:53.26,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,But why did the culprit\Nchoose {\i0}that{\i1} tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.16,0:27:00.51,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Hallways with standard tanks are\Ntoo dark to see more than silhouettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.08,0:27:04.77,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Why did they choose\Nthat brightly lit tunnel specifically?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.73,0:27:07.07,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Shinichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.26,0:27:11.19,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Ran, let me borrow your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.19,0:27:12.93,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I forgot mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.93,0:27:15.64,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Okay, but don't break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.64,0:27:17.74,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,My dad finally bought me this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.74,0:27:18.66,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.66,0:27:21.77,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Sorry, but could you turn around?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.77,0:27:23.58,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,What? Turn around?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.75,0:27:27.40,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,W-Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.40,0:27:28.74,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.74,0:27:32.51,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I thought the tunnel might\Nhave some significance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.96,0:27:36.44,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,That's because there are\Nfish everywhere you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.44,0:27:40.89,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,It feels like you're at\Nthe bottom of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.49,0:27:46.44,DCItalic,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,The front row is soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.02,0:27:50.52,DCItalic,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Something seems to have happened.\NShould we check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.71,0:27:55.12,DCItalic,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Something seems to have happened.\NShould we check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.12,0:27:56.07,DCItalic,JINBE,0,0,0,,No—
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.95,0:28:03.83,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,That's why it's a romantic place for a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.05,0:28:07.96,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Wait, Shinichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.25,0:28:11.49,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.15,0:28:14.35,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,So {\i0}that's{\i1} why the culprit chose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.40,0:28:21.64,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,This place that appears\Nsurrounded by the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.76,0:28:24.89,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs26\an8\frz-19\fax0.3\xshad-1.5\yshad2\move(317,343,317,200)\c&H6E3D2D&\4c&H411F22&}BEIKA {\fax0.4}AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.84,0:28:24.89,DCMain,POLICE A,0,0,0,,Inspector Megure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.56,0:28:29.28,DCMain,POLICE A,0,0,0,,The guests are demanding to know\Nwhen they can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.28,0:28:32.69,DCMain,POLICE A,0,0,0,,We're having them wait\Nin the dolphin show area.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.69,0:28:36.99,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,But we haven't identified the culprit yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.43,0:28:43.14,DCMain,POLICE A,0,0,0,,Perhaps the culprit fled the aquarium\Nimmediately after stabbing the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.14,0:28:47.00,DCMain,POLICE B,0,0,0,,It did take a few minutes to seal the exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.41,0:28:54.35,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,But the cameras there didn't capture any\Nsuspicious persons leaving in a hurry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.35,0:28:58.52,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Then let's have the guests leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.52,0:28:59.38,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.93,0:29:05.55,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Except those three suspects, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.14,0:29:09.89,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs22\an8\frz14\fax-0.3\xshad1\yshad2\move(295,195,295,-85)\4c&H3E2A29&\c&H513328&}BEIKA {\fax-0.2}AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.20,0:29:09.89,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.35,0:29:12.46,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Everyone else has left.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.46,0:29:15.50,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Why do {\i1}we{\i0} have to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.90,0:29:19.16,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I showed you the video\Nthat proves my alibi, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.16,0:29:20.76,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,You saw mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.76,0:29:21.91,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.22,0:29:29.91,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yes, but one of you filmed an odd video.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.27,0:29:35.72,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It practically told us you had done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.22,0:29:41.11,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me it's my dolphin show video.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.11,0:29:43.48,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Now, now. Hear him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.48,0:29:44.91,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,It's true, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.91,0:29:48.91,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,These two are a couple. They can make\Nsure they're telling the same story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.91,0:29:50.27,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.27,0:29:51.64,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.35,0:29:56.00,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You're Nakagiri Kanoko-san, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.00,0:29:57.40,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.74,0:29:59.99,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Your video was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.99,0:30:03.56,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It was shaky, and the sound\Nquality was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.55,0:30:03.56,DCItalicTop,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,The front row is soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.56,0:30:04.70,DCItalicTop,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,Hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.76,0:30:05.93,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,No one could watch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.93,0:30:08.17,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,I-I couldn't help that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.17,0:30:09.14,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,After all, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.14,0:30:11.58,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,That's right. It's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.58,0:30:13.83,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,After all, you're an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.15,0:30:15.22,DCMain,NAKAGIRI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.22,0:30:18.92,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Most amateur videos are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.40,0:30:24.34,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Compared to yours,\NJinbe-san's video was fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.64,0:30:28.06,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You got a clear shot of a\Nleisurely swimming shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.42,0:30:32.02,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,And that makes me the killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.02,0:30:33.23,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.23,0:30:37.29,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You're just used to taking videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.29,0:30:41.36,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You were going\Nto upload it to your blog, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.90,0:30:46.38,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,If you've uploaded numerous videos,\Nyou must've learned to shoot good ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.38,0:30:48.08,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,What? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.42,0:30:53.47,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yes. The problem is your girlfriend's.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.08,0:30:55.42,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.45,0:31:00.43,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Ojiro Naho-san's video.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.04,0:31:11.13,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yes. The problem is your girlfriend's.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.68,0:31:12.52,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.10,0:31:18.06,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Ojiro Naho-san's video.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.77,0:31:22.28,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong with my video?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.63,0:31:25.46,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,This is Ojiro-san's video.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.22,0:31:28.80,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,This is Jinbe-san's video.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.24,0:31:32.79,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Notice anything different between them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.79,0:31:38.59,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,J-Just that mine's horizontal\Nand hers is vertical.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.59,0:31:39.59,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.13,0:31:45.14,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Normally, if you wanted to shoot\Na long fish like a shark,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.64,0:31:48.47,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,you'd shoot horizontally like Jinbe-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.89,0:31:52.60,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You'd want its whole body in the frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.03,0:31:57.60,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But Ojiro-san's video is vertical,\Nand sure enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.14,0:32:02.94,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,the shark quickly cuts through\Nthe frame and disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.24,0:32:07.01,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,I-I wasn't trying to film the shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.01,0:32:09.28,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,That's not all that's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.13,0:32:18.29,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Normally, people avoid walking into the shot\Nwhen they see someone filming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.09,0:32:22.22,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Like you see in Jinbe-san's video.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.14,0:32:27.22,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But no one does that in Ojiro-san's.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.63,0:32:30.28,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They walk right through the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.28,0:32:36.10,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It's as though they had\Nno idea she was filming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.13,0:32:39.98,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.53,0:32:43.13,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It's no wonder they didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.13,0:32:45.73,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Because Ojiro-san placed her phone...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.09,0:32:53.87,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,inside the fold of Jinbe-san's hat\Nto film her video.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.23,0:33:02.13,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You'd have to look very closely to notice\Na white phone in a white hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.42,0:33:07.51,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,This allowed her to film a video that\Nlooks like she took it from behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.04,0:33:12.39,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,That's why she chose this tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.36,0:33:16.79,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,With fish on all sides,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.79,0:33:22.50,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,fish will appear in the shot\Nno matter which way you shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.27,0:33:27.78,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,But wouldn't he notice\Nif she put that in his hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.08,0:33:33.16,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,She probably said something\Nwas on his hat, took it off,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.16,0:33:37.66,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,inserted the phone, and put it back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.33,0:33:40.83,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It takes only a second to remove the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.83,0:33:45.39,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,And her video went blurry\Nat one point, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.89,0:33:48.63,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,That was likely\Nwhen she removed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.80,0:33:57.77,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,But people subconsciously move their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.77,0:34:00.22,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,The video shouldn't be so steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.06,0:34:02.69,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.09,0:34:06.94,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,After all, her boyfriend is wearing\Na brace for his injured neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.08,0:34:12.10,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,He can't suddenly move his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.10,0:34:14.45,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,H-How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.45,0:34:18.45,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,When I spoke from your side\Nduring your interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.97,0:34:23.08,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,you turned your entire body\Ninstead of just your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.08,0:34:28.59,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,While looking at your video, you also held\Nyour phone directly in front of your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.59,0:34:34.81,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,That's how I knew you couldn't look down\Nor turn your head due to a neck injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.81,0:34:39.39,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,Then while he was filming,\NOjiro-san killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.39,0:34:40.39,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.39,0:34:45.39,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,She found the victim waiting for her in this\Ntunnel and used a stun gun to knock him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.43,0:34:54.00,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Then she stabbed him in the heart and\Nreturned to Jinbe-san to retrieve her phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.00,0:34:57.60,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,I'm surprised no one saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.60,0:35:01.16,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It didn't matter if anyone saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.16,0:35:04.95,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,If she takes off her coat,\Nraises her skirt, and puts on a hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.95,0:35:06.92,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,she looks like a different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.92,0:35:10.42,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It's dark outside this bright tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.84,0:35:14.54,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It would have been easy enough to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.85,0:35:19.99,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there was\None thing you couldn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.74,0:35:23.73,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Yes, these gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.19,0:35:29.23,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Since they're reversible, you've\Nflipped them inside out to hide it...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.88,0:35:33.24,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.77,0:35:36.82,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The victim's blood is on your right finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.56,0:35:39.74,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,H-How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.15,0:35:42.49,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,The photo you took with your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.49,0:35:46.02,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Based on your clothes and the\Nbackground, you took it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.49,0:35:49.00,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\shad0\bord2\an8\frz2\fax-0.2\3c&HEEF2F0&\move(265,225,264,-135)\c&HAA866D&}BEIKA AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.02,0:35:49.00,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But your gloves were a different color.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.38,0:35:52.49,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,No one walks around with two pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.86,0:35:58.01,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,And you took that photo with your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.01,0:36:02.01,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You also showed the inspector\Nyour phone with your right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.38,0:36:05.02,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You're clearly right-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.02,0:36:10.40,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But you removed your left glove and\Nused your phone with your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.72,0:36:12.23,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Those facts,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.23,0:36:20.41,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,and the fact that some blood seeped through\Nthe bag the culprit used to stab the victim,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.73,0:36:23.27,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,lead to this conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.27,0:36:26.54,DCMain,MEGURE,0,0,0,,We'll have forensics examine the—
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.54,0:36:30.05,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Hurry up and examine it, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.05,0:36:33.80,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,I'd like to get that man's\Nblood off me as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.16,0:36:37.41,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,Th-Then, Naho, does that mean you...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.41,0:36:38.80,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.19,0:36:41.30,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,Have you heard of revenge porn?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.69,0:36:46.85,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,It's when an ex-lover plasters\Nembarrassing photos of someone online.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.10,0:36:52.84,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,He said he sent a few to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.84,0:36:55.86,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,So those shady messages...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.20,0:36:57.39,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.39,0:37:00.32,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,They contained photos of me\NI don't want anyone seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.32,0:37:03.28,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,You deleted them without opening them,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.28,0:37:07.00,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,but he threatened to {\i1}call{\i0} you next.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.41,0:37:11.01,DCMain,JINBE,0,0,0,,How'd he even get my contact information?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.03,0:37:16.90,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,When I went to his place to break up\Nbecause I'd found someone new,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:23.97,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,he looked through my phone\Nwhile I was in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.78,0:37:30.12,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,"If you don't want your boyfriend, job, and\Nfamily seeing these photos, give me money."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.12,0:37:33.03,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,"I'm up to my neck in debt."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.78,0:37:38.51,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,So I spilled his blood instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.29,0:37:42.99,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,But I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.73,0:37:49.03,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,If I hadn't spilled blood on my gloves and\Nreversed them, you may not have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.03,0:37:50.09,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.99,0:37:53.41,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It was obvious even if you hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.41,0:37:54.25,DCMain,OJIRO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.08,0:38:01.27,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,In Jinbe-san's video, you were\Nwearing both of your gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.78,0:38:05.13,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You took one off\Nwhen you used your left hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.13,0:38:09.02,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,which means those gloves must\Nprevent you from using a smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.72,0:38:14.77,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But you've been pretending that you filmed\Na smartphone video with those gloves on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.42,0:38:22.15,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It was proof you'd done something\Nthat required you to wear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.87,0:38:24.99,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,It was a simple deduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.17,0:40:02.67,sign_1187_aquarium_building,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\an8\frz12\fax-0.3\xshad1\yshad2\move(308,367,308,185)\4c&H412510&\c&H783722&}BEIKA {\fax-0.2}AQUARIUM
Dialogue: 1,0:40:01.66,0:40:04.60,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You should call it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:10.91,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,After what happened, you shouldn't\Nuse your Romantic Reunion Plan there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.91,0:40:12.18,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.28,0:40:17.43,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Aw, man, it's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.33,0:40:19.65,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Let's run home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.65,0:40:21.09,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Wait, your hood!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.09,0:40:22.65,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.45,0:40:26.07,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,My phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.21,0:40:31.36,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.36,0:40:34.35,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Why was it inside my hood?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.35,0:40:35.58,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.58,0:40:39.88,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I was thinking of where\Nthe culprit put her phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.88,0:40:43.34,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I just remembered I put it in your hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:46.89,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,How could you do this? I just got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.89,0:40:48.24,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.24,0:40:51.30,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I'll buy you a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.30,0:40:55.15,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,This sucks! Nothing good\Never happens when I'm with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.15,0:40:58.72,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Things kept happening when\Nwe went to America, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.72,0:41:00.94,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.28,0:41:02.97,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Tropical Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.97,0:41:04.93,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I'll take you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.97,0:41:07.76,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Tropical Land?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.76,0:41:09.95,DCItalic,RAN/ID,0,0,0,,That's a cheerful sounding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.26,0:41:13.02,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,They're building one in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.02,0:41:16.84,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I'm sure nothing will happen\Nat an amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.33,0:41:20.47,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,I'll go only if you'll pay for {\i1}everything{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.47,0:41:21.46,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.87,0:41:25.55,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Fine, then how about paying\Nif I win my karate tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.55,0:41:27.40,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.40,0:41:29.45,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Last year, you placed second.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.45,0:41:34.05,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,And the third-year who won\Nquit the team, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.05,0:41:35.55,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,It's a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.24,0:41:37.54,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.40,0:41:41.51,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,I don't have much of an allowance...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.42,0:41:49.18,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,And if you're buying me a phone, get a sea\Ncucumber strap from the aquarium, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.18,0:41:50.68,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.68,0:41:55.93,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But if you're planning to win, you'd\Nbetter get that right hand healed soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.93,0:41:56.93,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.12,0:42:01.83,DCItalic,RAN/ID,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.26,0:42:06.66,DCFlashback,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But it looks like you have\Nanother reason you can't cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.77,0:42:10.37,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Hey, Shinichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.37,0:42:12.38,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,How'd you know about my right hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.82,0:42:15.36,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,When you got Sonoko's message,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.36,0:42:20.39,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,you just checked your messages from her\Nand your mom but didn't reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.06,0:42:23.73,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,On top of that,\Nyou were using your left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.73,0:42:30.59,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,You probably hurt your right hand and\Nweren't dexterous enough to write a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.32,0:42:36.13,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,Since you didn't remove your glove,\Nyou probably bandaged your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.13,0:42:40.54,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But you seem determined\Nto win your tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.54,0:42:42.80,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,so it's just a sprained finger, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.47,0:42:46.54,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,Yeah. It happened during karate practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.54,0:42:51.72,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,But if it doesn't get better\Nand you don't win,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.72,0:42:53.93,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,I won't have to pay for your visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.44,0:42:57.36,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,It'll {\i1}definitely{\i0} get better,\Nand I'll {\i1}definitely{\i0} win.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.36,0:43:00.55,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,And I'll make you spend a {\i1}fortune{\i0} on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.09,0:43:04.81,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.42,0:43:09.59,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,I'm here to check out\NTropical Land in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.45,0:43:18.18,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Mystery Coaster and...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.18,0:43:20.58,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Dragon Coaster, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.92,0:43:23.08,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Which should I choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.65,0:43:27.30,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Ran is scared of ghosts, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.30,0:43:29.78,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,I guess we'll go with the Dragon Coaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.78,0:43:31.68,DCMain,GIRLFRIEND,0,0,0,,Sheesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.68,0:43:34.70,DCMain,GIRLFRIEND,0,0,0,,The Mystery Coaster was so scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.26,0:43:38.30,DCMain,BOYFRIEND,0,0,0,,It's not like those ghosts were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.13,0:43:46.31,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,No, we'll go with\Nthe Mystery Coaster after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.10,0:45:30.67,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Whew, it's totally dark out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.06,0:45:36.73,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Well, I found some decent attractions and\Nrides, and places to get lunch and dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.73,0:45:38.43,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,This should be plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.06,0:45:42.55,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,A fountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.55,0:45:44.44,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,There's one here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.44,0:45:47.06,DCMain,AOKO,0,0,0,,Maybe it seems out of character,\Nbut this is who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.44,0:45:49.51,DCMain,AOKO,0,0,0,,Honestly, he's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.53,0:45:53.20,DCMain,AOKO,0,0,0,,Just like ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.90,0:45:57.91,DCMain,KID,0,0,0,,But ice cream...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.94,0:46:00.63,DCMain,KID,0,0,0,,is sweet, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.41,0:46:09.27,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Is this guy for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.27,0:46:10.66,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Talk about embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.04,0:46:14.02,DCMain,AOKO,0,0,0,,Don't be so cringy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.40,0:46:18.17,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,But ending the day\Nat this fountain could be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.98,0:46:21.77,DCItalic,SHINICHI/ID,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm definitely coming here with Ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.35,0:46:22.34,DCMainTop,AOKO,0,0,0,,This ice cream is good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.34,0:46:23.64,DCMainTop,KID,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.12,0:46:27.34,DCItalic,CONAN,0,0,0,,But I never did get\Nto visit this fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.39,0:46:51.00,DCMainTop,KID,0,0,0,,30 years, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.68,0:46:55.09,sign_dont_miss,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,608)}Don't miss the next episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.32,0:46:52.36,DCMainTop,AOKO,0,0,0,,Isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.36,0:46:55.09,DCMainTop,CONAN,0,0,0,,The anime's 30th-anniversary \Nyear is now starting!